:8270128,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNzAxMjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8270128?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart","html_url":"https://github.com/pbeart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T15:18:27Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T15:18:27Z","body":"After letting the project grow a bit (adding various kinds of resources and nodes), the application freezes for about 1 second whenever a tooltip is rendered, and dialogs like Add Node take about 5 seconds to appear","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678776732/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691713111","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103087#issuecomment-2691713111","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103087","id":2691713111,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gcEhX","user":{"login":"DizzasterDev","id":198997071,"node_id":"U_kgDOC9x0Tw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198997071?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev","html_url":"https://github.com/DizzasterDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T23:27:46Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T23:27:46Z","body":"If you enable Single Window Mode in the editor settings (interface/editor/single_window_mode) and restart the engine, does the stutter still occur?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691713111/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695840396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103087#issuecomment-2695840396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103087","id":2695840396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gr0KM","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T23:58:40Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T23:59:29Z","body":"This is likely because you have a Vulkan layer that is very slow to initialize, and it's initialized for every tooltip as it's a separate window. There is unfortunately no way for us to fix this, other than finding the layer that causes this and [preventing it from being initialized with the Godot editor](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9f68a816599412c56a4626dd6c47244ebc65ed1f/main/main.cpp#L2520-L2525).\n\nI suggest running the Vulkan Configurator from the [Vulkan SDK](https://www.lunarg.com/vulkan-sdk/) so you can take a look at the enabled layers. Alternatively, switch to the `d3d12` rendering driver in the Project Settings (`rendering/rendering_device/driver.windows`).\n\nEnabling **Single Window Mode** in the Editor Settings will avoid the issue, as tooltips will no longer be separate windows and won't require their own Vulkan initialization.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695840396/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695934450","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103087#issuecomment-2695934450","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103087","id":2695934450,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gsLHy","user":{"login":"DizzasterDev","id":198997071,"node_id":"U_kgDOC9x0Tw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198997071?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev","html_url":"https://github.com/DizzasterDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DizzasterDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T01:16:45Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T01:16:45Z","body":"Is it possible that the initialization of a tooltip/window can cause the engine to freeze indefinitely? This would perfectly explain the stutter/freezes I am experiencing from what i've gathered so far (see #100958).\n\nI will definitely check out the Vulkan SDK when I have the time, hopefully i'm able to find something. Thanks for the tip!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695934450/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2696768878","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103087#issuecomment-2696768878","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103087","id":2696768878,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gvW1u","user":{"login":"pbeart","id":8270128,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNzAxMjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8270128?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart","html_url":"https://github.com/pbeart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbeart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T09:16:38Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T09:16:38Z","body":"> If you enable Single Window Mode in the editor settings (interface/editor/single_window_mode) and restart the engine, does the stutter still occur?\n\nIt does indeed go away! Thank you for the tip \n\nInterestingly paint.net has the same problem when it tries to create new dialogue boxes, so it seems like this really is a bug for Intel graphics cards across all applications","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2696768878/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2745522875","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103087#issuecomment-2745522875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103087","id":2745522875,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jpVq7","user":{"login":"xrabohrok","i